---
NOVA is a persistent memory MCP server. The float-confidence JSON shard store
holds conversation history; the `.shard` files indexed here are a separate
curated facts corpus with discrete {-1, 0, 1} confidence. HUGINN runs the
JSON store over dense embeddings; nova_facts_search runs this corpus via
SQLite keyword pre-filter before HUGINN.
